<title>LITHUANIA: STOCK MARKET BOURSE SUSPENSIONS.</title>
<headline>STOCK MARKET BOURSE SUSPENSIONS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lithuanian bourse said on Tuesday that trade in the following shares would be suspended:</p>
<p>- Snoras Bank, 15.04.97, for three trading sessions, because of assimilation of share issues.</p>
<p>- Siauliu Bank, 15.04/97, for three trading sessions, because of assimilation of share issues.</p>
<p>- Lithuanian Energy, 15.04.97, for up to three months, because of the cancellation of part of its shares.</p>
<p>- Sema, 15.04.97, for up to three months, because of the increase of authorized capital from reserves.</p>
<p>- Sanitas, 15.04.97, for up to three months, because of the increase of authorized capital from reserves.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 18</p>
</text>
